{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa4280ae5ca9ee3ed0fbdf6ef4cfd52b40e282710f308892cc917d33fa12100",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33eb7b03c77f1cfbd72959ecc6fdc0e817ebcae36d273fcc7c02c4943a684cf",
      "text": "可疑的男极，可疑的LIVE",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb551c995d07cd4c4811656dd991e6bd3ecbe521933293c0800050981d05588d",
      "text": "原定举办的男极“知识部门”被取消，\n男极联赛本身也唐突地迎来了尾声。\n尽管心生疑惑，315 Pro的众人还是开始回归日常。\n数日后，前男极主办方发来的一封邮件送到了他们手中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000023:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d811f7563c90e10ce6c36d183b8417e0e4362c281ceb20eccb2636b4f5ab7ada",
      "text": "第9话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000023:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33eb7b03c77f1cfbd72959ecc6fdc0e817ebcae36d273fcc7c02c4943a684cf",
      "text": "可疑的男极，可疑的LIVE",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85253d4f7d42ac04109920fbc80cb9b2016566d8bcdbd9babfebf4472594eb39",
      "text": "Hi！F-LAGS的各位。\n听说在同一个演播室，我就过来了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef15186b8f544a88c7c283e999e020e97942c7c88bb8beb8b7a2860a41d85fa",
      "text": "哇，类先生！辛苦了。\n工作已经结束了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95433efe4bf1b5907c6b9dd7ec60a617f9310705a1f1dd65a17aa555bda04702",
      "text": "没～有，只是稍微休息一会儿～。\n你们呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35940b0c8858e6fdf242dccde66c78d54832931dde9832af3ce08b2e1f352ac",
      "text": "俺们刚刚才结束！\n所以正说着要不要去瞧瞧类的情况哩。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79ae243ef8d5fa8720308e9255eec8ea543389138542daeb89e6431ed24c1f90",
      "text": "Wow, nice timing！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cec14f671da846758480326b8bbf35f886fc2033c5cbb1369c99d8f8d1ca621",
      "text": "那，现在能不能占用一点时间，\n听听我的咨询呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:806b81906fd09a1d24e9475a2045c15e25fac010b24a31192b1679f54cdb607f",
      "text": "…当然可以。请问是什么咨询呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8061c9d296970afb9459183fc2ee6533694ae9df2a596f5ecce4d614256493e",
      "text": "其实，最近Mr. 硲有些消沉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36ffce897606e83b5c4a75e45326f2f6872655934b5fd34e970b33e083b36359",
      "text": "因为他一直期待的男极“知识部门”被取消了嘛。\n有没有能让他打起精神来的好idea呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56a7a2c51b02de96361370cc08906007c692759d5db60b1efb74b9ee80140af0",
      "text": "嗯……啊，做道夫先生喜欢吃的东西\n给他吃怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b1023191f4c345609b9fbb427fffbe9979243877d345d211bbb9f8620b2f23b",
      "text": "我完全不会做饭呀～。\n家里连冰箱都没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faa0660e551867f2ab26345d7ad01b9d47b130bc5468b7cd566c491929e3623b",
      "text": "…向他推荐能让人沉浸于另一个世界的\n小说，怎么样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c72c08735c4e0e7cc6cce4f048d1402fa580677684d8630bb13128120f468eee",
      "text": "书啊～。漫画也可以吗？\n那样的话我或许能推荐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:137cb00ffaa68c0e69853dc0db882e4b448728b7b11bcdd67cb816497a340e03",
      "text": "哦，俺也喜欢漫画！用这种\n自己拿手的事去鼓励他，俺觉得挺好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000226:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:174d723592ce26d45ea84b72947deee64bc2775b03c725049e688bde5b8c8953",
      "text": "我拿手的事……\nEnglish、talk，还有smile吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
